WEBVTT

00:02.210 --> 00:03.336
Are you ready kids?
孩子们准备好了吗？

00:03.420 --> 00:05.255
Children: Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：是啊是啊，队长！

00:05.338 --> 00:06.548
I can't hear you!
我听不到你说话！

00:06.631 --> 00:08.925
Children: Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：是啊是啊，队长！

00:09.008 --> 00:11.803
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.886 --> 00:13.596
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.680 --> 00:15.724
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.807 --> 00:17.767
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.851 --> 00:19.811
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.894 --> 00:21.688
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.771 --> 00:23.690
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.773 --> 00:25.567
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.650 --> 00:26.985
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.068 --> 00:28.319
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:28.403 --> 00:29.738
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.821 --> 00:31.698
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.781 --> 00:33.658
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.742 --> 00:37.370
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

01:06.065 --> 01:07.776
good morning, Gary.
早上好，加里。

01:07.859 --> 01:09.569
Meow.
喵。

01:09.652 --> 01:13.406
Say, Gary, do you ever
wonder what Patrick's
mornings are like?
说，加里，你有没有
想知道帕特里克的是什么
早晨是什么样的？

01:18.995 --> 01:20.121
Huh?
啊？

01:20.205 --> 01:21.080
What?
什么？

01:21.164 --> 01:24.000
Aah!
啊啊！

01:24.083 --> 01:26.211
Aah...!
啊啊……！

01:26.294 --> 01:28.338
What's making that noise?
是什么发出这种声音？

01:31.049 --> 01:36.679
Oh, it's you again.
噢，又是你。

01:38.223 --> 01:40.767
O.K., jokes over.
好吧，玩笑结束了。

01:43.603 --> 01:44.938
All right, you got me...
好吧，你抓住了我...

01:45.021 --> 01:46.272
Now cut it out.
现在把它剪掉。

01:47.649 --> 01:48.942
That's it.
就是这样。

01:50.693 --> 01:52.362
Stop your ringing, mister.
别再按铃了，先生。

01:52.445 --> 01:53.947
I'm warning you.
我警告你。

01:54.030 --> 01:55.448
Stop it!
停下来！

01:55.532 --> 01:57.325
I said, quit it!
我说，放弃吧！

02:00.453 --> 02:01.788
Oh?
哦？

02:01.871 --> 02:04.415
Then where's it coming from?
那么它从哪里来呢？

02:04.499 --> 02:05.458
Make it stop.
让它停止。

02:07.418 --> 02:11.548
Buddy, you gotta help me
find out where that
ringing is coming from.
伙计，你一定要帮帮我
找出那个地方
铃声是从那里传来的。

02:11.631 --> 02:13.550
Hey, come back!
嘿，回来吧！

02:13.633 --> 02:15.885
Oh, fine, I'll ask
someone who cares.
哦，好的，我去问问
关心的人。

02:22.016 --> 02:25.019
SpongeBob, where's
the ringing coming from?
海绵宝宝，在哪里
铃声从何而来？

02:31.067 --> 02:34.070
Breakfast.
早餐。

02:34.153 --> 02:36.114
Come to Patrick.
来帕特里克吧。

02:36.197 --> 02:37.532
Tartar sauce.
鞑靼酱。

02:37.615 --> 02:38.825
I'm out of food again.
我又没饭吃了

02:38.908 --> 02:41.327
All I have are these lousy cans
我只有这些破罐头

02:41.411 --> 02:43.454
with pictures of food on 'em.
上面有食物的图片。

02:43.538 --> 02:48.334
I wanted real food,
not pictures.
我想要真正的食物，
不是图片。

02:48.418 --> 02:50.128
Ooh...
哦...

02:50.211 --> 02:53.548
The food is in the can.
食物在罐子里。

02:56.259 --> 03:02.098
O.K., come on out.
好吧，出来吧。

03:02.181 --> 03:03.182
Come on.
快点。

03:03.266 --> 03:04.851
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

03:07.937 --> 03:11.357
O.K., breakfast,
get on the plate.
好的，早餐，
上盘子。

03:11.441 --> 03:12.692
Come on.
快点。

03:12.775 --> 03:16.571
Nice comfy plate, just for you.
漂亮舒适的盘子，只为您而设计。

03:16.654 --> 03:19.449
Come on, get on there.
来吧，上那儿。

03:19.532 --> 03:22.535
Hello?
你好？

03:22.619 --> 03:23.995
Anybody in there?
里面有人吗？

03:25.121 --> 03:26.331
no answer.
没有答案。

03:26.414 --> 03:28.082
I'm coming to rescue you!
我来救你了！

03:29.751 --> 03:31.878
Having a little
trouble reaching you.
有一点
无法联系到您。

03:36.132 --> 03:37.592
Stupid cans.
愚蠢的罐头。

03:39.177 --> 03:40.219
Oh...
哦...

03:40.303 --> 03:41.971
Food.
食物。

03:43.473 --> 03:47.977
Ah, my favorite time of the day.
啊，一天中我最喜欢的时间。

03:48.061 --> 03:51.272
Breakfast and a little
morning television.
早餐还有一点点
早间电视。

03:51.356 --> 03:57.987
Announcer: And now, live from
Bikini Bottom, it's "Bikini
Bottom Live".
播音员：现在，直播
比基尼泳裤，它是“比基尼
底层生活”。

04:05.370 --> 04:06.579
Oh, my gosh.
哦，天哪。

04:07.664 --> 04:08.581
I'm late!
我来晚了！

04:08.665 --> 04:09.582
I'm late!
我来晚了！

04:09.666 --> 04:10.708
I'm late!
我来晚了！

04:12.210 --> 04:13.711
I gotta put on my teeth and
brush my pants!
我必须戴上牙齿
擦我的裤子！

04:14.921 --> 04:15.964
Ooh...!
噢...！

04:17.048 --> 04:18.508
Gary?
加里？

04:21.636 --> 04:22.804
Pants.
裤子。

04:25.848 --> 04:28.518
A clean mouth is a happy mouth.
干净的嘴就是幸福的嘴。

04:28.601 --> 04:29.978
Darn.
该死。

04:35.817 --> 04:38.444
Hey, Patrick,
how was your morning?
嘿，帕特里克，
你早上过得怎么样？

04:38.528 --> 04:41.948
Oh, you know, the usual.
哦，你知道，平常的。

04:59.799 --> 05:00.925
What's this?
这是什么？

05:01.009 --> 05:03.094
This is a free prize!
这是免费奖品！

05:17.650 --> 05:20.153
Huh?
啊？

05:20.236 --> 05:21.237
Where's my prize?
我的奖品在哪里？

05:22.613 --> 05:24.198
Free prize...
免费奖品...

05:25.158 --> 05:26.617
Offer inside!
里面优惠！

05:26.701 --> 05:29.370
Just send in 99 box tops!
只需送99盒顶盖即可！

05:33.958 --> 05:36.085
How ya doing over there, Gary?
加里，你在那儿怎么样？

05:36.169 --> 05:39.422
Meow.
喵。

05:39.505 --> 05:40.339
Meow.
喵。

05:40.423 --> 05:43.176
Send in the box tops
送入盒顶

05:44.594 --> 05:45.887
before eating all the cereal?
在吃完所有谷物之前？

05:45.970 --> 05:49.849
Gary, you are a genius!
加里，你是个天才！

05:53.644 --> 05:55.313
I'm waiting.
我在等。

05:55.396 --> 05:56.355
I'm waiting.
我在等。

05:56.439 --> 05:57.523
I'm waiting...
我在等...

05:57.607 --> 05:58.775
Both: I'm waiting.
两人：我在等。

05:58.858 --> 05:59.859
We're waiting.
我们正在等待。

05:59.942 --> 06:01.152
We're waiting.
我们正在等待。

06:01.235 --> 06:02.195
We're waiting.
我们正在等待。

06:02.278 --> 06:03.362
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

06:03.446 --> 06:04.697
What're we waiting for?
我们还等什么？

06:04.781 --> 06:05.990
We're waiting for the mailman.
我们正在等邮递员。

06:06.074 --> 06:07.700
He's bringing me a free toy.
他给我带来了一个免费的玩具。

06:07.784 --> 06:09.827
I love toys!
我喜欢玩具！

06:09.911 --> 06:12.205
Can I wait for
your toy with you?
我可以等吗
你的玩具在你身边吗？

06:12.288 --> 06:13.539
Why sure.
为什么肯定。

06:13.623 --> 06:14.624
We're waiting.
我们正在等待。

06:14.707 --> 06:15.708
We're waiting.
我们正在等待。

06:15.792 --> 06:17.210
We're waiting.
我们正在等待。

06:17.293 --> 06:18.795
There's the mailman!
邮递员来了！

06:18.878 --> 06:20.254
You SpongeBob SquarePants?
你是海绵宝宝吗？

06:20.338 --> 06:21.547
Yep.
是的。

06:25.176 --> 06:26.636
Isn't there anything else?
难道就没有别的事了吗？

06:26.719 --> 06:27.637
Nope.
没有。

06:27.720 --> 06:28.679
Sorry, kid.
对不起，孩子。

06:30.181 --> 06:32.183
Guess we'll have
to keep waiting.
猜猜我们会有
继续等待。

06:37.855 --> 06:39.398
Hey, SpongeBob, I'm hungry.
嘿，海绵宝宝，我饿了。

06:39.482 --> 06:41.400
Both:
两个都：

06:41.484 --> 06:44.403
Both:
两个都：

06:44.487 --> 06:46.280
Me too.
我也是。

06:46.364 --> 06:48.783
Let's go down to the Krusty
Krab for a Krabby Patty.
让我们去Krusty吧
蟹肉饼。

06:48.866 --> 06:50.243
Great idea, Patrick.
好主意，帕特里克。

06:50.326 --> 06:51.410
Krusty Krab, here we...
蟹堡王，我们...

06:51.494 --> 06:52.912
Wait a minute!
等一下！

06:52.995 --> 06:54.455
What if the mailman
comes when I'm gone?
如果邮递员怎么办
当我离开时来吗？

06:56.707 --> 06:58.251
What's wrong, SpongeBob?
怎么了，海绵宝宝？

06:58.334 --> 07:00.795
If I leave, the mailman might
come, and I might miss him.
如果我离开，邮递员可能会
来吧，我可能会想念他。

07:00.878 --> 07:02.463
Oh, I'm gonna take off then.
哦，那我要走了。

07:02.547 --> 07:04.757
I don't think my arm can stand
much more of this.
我觉得我的手臂无法站立
还有更多这样的事情。

07:12.348 --> 07:14.725
Got to stay focused.
必须保持专注。

07:16.686 --> 07:17.937
Hiya!
嗨！

07:18.020 --> 07:20.773
Hey, SpongeBob,
wanna do some kara...
嘿，海绵宝宝，
想做点卡拉...

07:20.857 --> 07:21.983
Not now, I'm busy.
现在不行，我很忙。

07:29.198 --> 07:30.575
Oh, Gary, not now.
哦，加里，不是现在。

07:30.658 --> 07:32.785
Can't you see that I'm
waiting for the mailman?
难道你看不出我是
等待邮递员？

07:32.869 --> 07:36.455
Doesn't anyone understand this?
难道没有人明白这一点吗？

07:40.877 --> 07:42.545
So tired...
这么累...

07:42.628 --> 07:44.338
So hungry...
好饿……

07:44.422 --> 07:47.300
But must wait for toy.
但必须等待玩具。

07:47.383 --> 07:48.259
Hey, buddy.
嘿，伙计。

07:48.342 --> 07:49.343
What?
什么？

07:49.427 --> 07:50.887
What do you want?
你想要什么？

07:50.970 --> 07:53.723
Can't you see I'm doing
something here?
你看不到我在做什么吗
这里有东西吗？

07:55.349 --> 07:56.851
This better be good.
这最好是好的。

07:56.934 --> 07:58.644
You missed your surprise
birthday party,
你错过了你的惊喜
生日聚会，

07:58.728 --> 08:01.522
so I just wanted to bring you a
present and some cake,
所以我只是想给你带来一个
礼物和一些蛋糕，

08:01.606 --> 08:02.648
'cause you missed it.
因为你错过了。

08:02.732 --> 08:04.817
My birthday party?
我的生日聚会？

08:04.901 --> 08:06.694
I missed my birthday party?
我错过了我的生日聚会吗？

08:06.777 --> 08:08.654
Yeah... See?
是啊...看到了吗？

08:08.738 --> 08:10.489
Here's a present and your cake.
这是一份礼物和你的蛋糕。

08:10.573 --> 08:12.158
My birthday cake.
我的生日蛋糕。

08:12.241 --> 08:16.829
Yeah, let me get you a fork,
so you can eat it.
是的，我给你拿把叉子，
所以你可以吃它。

08:16.913 --> 08:23.669
Uh, let me just hold the cake
like this, so like I can get you
a fork.
呃，让我拿着蛋糕
就像这样，就像我能得到你一样
叉子。

08:23.753 --> 08:25.004
Patrick: Huh.
帕特里克：嗯。

08:25.087 --> 08:26.881
I wonder where I put that fork?
我想知道我把叉子放在哪里了？

08:26.964 --> 08:28.424
Oops.
哎呀。

08:28.507 --> 08:29.884
That was my cake.
那是我的蛋糕。

08:29.967 --> 08:31.636
What is the present?
现在是什么？

08:31.719 --> 08:32.803
Oh, yeah...
哦，是的...

08:32.887 --> 08:34.222
The fork!
叉子！

08:38.309 --> 08:40.728
That stupid toy!
那个愚蠢的玩具！

08:40.811 --> 08:44.815
I wasted my whole
life waiting for it.
我浪费了我的全部
生活在等待着它。

08:44.899 --> 08:47.193
Actually, you've
only been here 20 min...
事实上，你已经
只到这里20分钟...

08:47.276 --> 08:52.281
I've been mean to Gary,
and I flipped Sandy.
我对加里很刻薄
我翻转了桑迪。

08:52.365 --> 08:56.244
And now you hate me 'cause,
I'm a big jerk.
现在你恨我因为
我是个大混蛋。

08:57.453 --> 08:58.412
No, I don't.
不，我不。

08:58.496 --> 08:59.789
Yes, you do.
是的，你知道。

08:59.872 --> 09:01.749
SpongeBob SquarePants?
海绵宝宝？

09:01.832 --> 09:03.042
Could you come back later?
你能晚点回来吗？

09:03.125 --> 09:04.794
He's having a moment.
他正在享受一段时光。

09:04.877 --> 09:07.546
Yeah, I just need
his signature for...
是的，我只需要
他的签名为...

09:07.630 --> 09:09.340
I said he's having a moment!
我说他有时间！

09:09.423 --> 09:10.383
Now leave him alone!
现在别管他了！

09:11.550 --> 09:12.969
No, Patrick...
不，帕特里克...

09:13.052 --> 09:16.597
People like me don't
deserve moments.
像我这样的人不
值得的时刻。

09:16.681 --> 09:18.057
I got so caught up in...
我是如此陷入...

09:18.140 --> 09:19.392
Oh, here ya go.
哦，给你。

09:19.475 --> 09:20.726
Waiting for my...
等待着我的...

09:20.810 --> 09:22.270
My toy!
我的玩具！

09:26.440 --> 09:27.608
Whoo!
呼！

09:27.692 --> 09:29.402
Whoo, yeah!
呼，是啊！

09:45.584 --> 09:50.298
Patrick, are you thinkin'
what I'm thinkin'?
帕特里克，你在想吗
我在想什么？

09:50.381 --> 09:51.591
Yep.
是的。

09:51.674 --> 09:53.301
Both: It's beautiful.
两人：真漂亮。

09:57.596 --> 09:58.931
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

09:59.015 --> 10:01.726
I waited so long.
我等了这么久。

10:01.809 --> 10:02.852
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

10:02.935 --> 10:04.687
And you broke it.
而你却打破了它。

10:04.770 --> 10:06.230
You O.K., buddy?
你还好吗，伙计？

10:06.314 --> 10:07.523
Yes...
是的...

10:07.606 --> 10:08.733
Yes, I'm ok.
是的，我没事。

10:08.816 --> 10:10.860
: For a sec...
: 一会儿...

10:10.943 --> 10:12.570
You...!
你...！

10:12.653 --> 10:15.906
You ruined my free toy!
你毁了我的免费玩具！

10:15.990 --> 10:17.616
I'm sorry.
对不起。

10:17.700 --> 10:19.368
Maybe if you just...
也许如果你只是...

10:19.452 --> 10:21.370
Ah...!
啊...！

10:21.454 --> 10:24.790
Ah...!
啊...！

10:24.874 --> 10:26.500
Ah...!
啊...！

10:36.719 --> 10:38.596
Just keep walking, Squiddy.
继续走吧，鱿鱼。

10:38.679 --> 10:39.597
Don't make eye contact.
不要进行目光接触。

10:47.063 --> 10:49.106
Argh...
啊啊……

10:49.190 --> 10:52.902
: Now to sooth
my frayed nerves.
: 现在来安慰一下
我紧张的神经。

10:54.320 --> 10:57.656
SpongeBob and Patrick:
海绵宝宝和帕特里克：

10:57.740 --> 11:00.117
All right, what's going on?
好吧，发生什么事了？

11:00.201 --> 11:01.911
Why are you two crying?
你们两个为什么哭？

11:03.579 --> 11:05.915
: I, I ate
box, box, box tops...
: 我、我吃了
盒子、盒子、盒子顶……

11:05.998 --> 11:08.167
And then, I'm waiting,
I'm waiting...
然后，我就等着，
我在等...

11:08.250 --> 11:09.794
And then he, he came...
然后他，他来了……

11:09.877 --> 11:10.836
And then we're waiting...
然后我们就等着...

11:10.920 --> 11:12.004
We're waiting...
我们正在等待...

11:12.088 --> 11:13.047
And then, my toy...
然后，我的玩具...

11:13.130 --> 11:14.173
And then you...
然后你...

11:14.256 --> 11:15.383
And then snap...
然后啪...

11:15.466 --> 11:16.675
And then this.
然后这个。

11:22.765 --> 11:24.058
There, now see?
在那里，现在看到了吗？

11:24.141 --> 11:27.061
It's supposed to do that.
它应该这样做。

11:27.144 --> 11:29.730
Hey, my toy's O.K.
嘿，我的玩具没问题。

11:29.814 --> 11:30.856
Good.
好的。

11:30.940 --> 11:32.358
Now will you two be quiet?
现在你们两个能安静点吗？

11:32.441 --> 11:34.944
Look, Patrick,
Squidward fixed it.
看，帕特里克，
章鱼哥修好了它。

11:35.027 --> 11:37.446
How can we ever thank you?
我们该如何感谢你呢？

11:37.530 --> 11:39.865
Yeah, how can we thank you?
是啊，我们该怎么感谢你呢？

11:39.949 --> 11:42.201
Move to another neighborhood.
搬到另一个街区。

11:55.840 --> 11:57.508
Krabby Patties...
蟹黄饼...

11:57.591 --> 11:58.968
Coming right up, sir.
马上就上来，先生。

12:00.302 --> 12:01.637
Meow.
喵。

12:15.985 --> 12:17.528
Gary, what are you doing?
加里，你在做什么？

12:17.611 --> 12:19.155
Meow.
喵。

12:19.238 --> 12:21.323
SpongeBob: Oh, my gosh,
your bowl's empty.
海绵宝宝：哦，天哪，
你的碗空了。

12:21.407 --> 12:24.952
Not to worry, Gare-Gare,
food is on the way.
别担心，Gare-Gare，
食物正在路上。

12:25.035 --> 12:26.745
Faster than you can say...
比你说的还要快...

12:26.829 --> 12:28.247
organic.
有机的。

12:28.330 --> 12:29.290
Meow.
喵。

12:33.085 --> 12:34.587
There ya go, Gary.
就这样吧，加里。

12:36.505 --> 12:37.339
Yuck.
恶心。

12:43.888 --> 12:45.473
Gary, shame on you.
加里，你真丢脸。

12:45.556 --> 12:48.601
I realize you're a bottom
feeder, but have some manners.
我发现你是个底层
喂食者，但要有一定的礼仪。

12:48.684 --> 12:51.187
You know you're not supposed to
eat goop off the ground.
你知道你不应该这样做
吃地上的粘液。

12:51.270 --> 12:54.774
SpongeBob: Now go on and
enjoy your health food.
海绵宝宝：现在继续
享受你的健康食品。

12:56.192 --> 12:58.611
What is this stuff anyway?
这到底是什么东西？

13:00.279 --> 13:02.198
Doesn't seem to be coming off.
好像没下来啊

13:03.699 --> 13:07.244
Ooh, company.
哦，公司。

13:08.829 --> 13:09.747
Hi Sponge...
海绵你好...

13:10.831 --> 13:11.957
Something wrong, Patrick?
有什么问题吗，帕特里克？

13:12.041 --> 13:14.668
SpongeBob, what is that?
海绵宝宝，那是什么？

13:14.752 --> 13:16.003
What's what?
什么是什么？

13:16.086 --> 13:17.755
This!
这！

13:17.838 --> 13:19.965
Aah...!
啊啊……！

13:21.634 --> 13:22.843
P-P-P-Patrick.
帕-帕-帕-帕特里克。

13:22.927 --> 13:24.470
What should I do?
我应该怎么办？

13:24.553 --> 13:26.472
Scratch it like
there's no tomorrow.
刮一下就像
没有明天。

13:26.555 --> 13:28.474
Good idea.
好主意。

13:28.557 --> 13:30.142
Uh, SpongeBob?
呃，海绵宝宝？

13:30.226 --> 13:31.560
Yeah?
是的？

13:31.644 --> 13:32.728
Patrick: I don't
know about this.
帕特里克：我不
了解这一点。

13:32.811 --> 13:34.605
What makes you say that?
是什么让你这么说？

13:34.688 --> 13:35.564
This...
这...

13:35.648 --> 13:37.608
Ah...!
啊...！

13:37.691 --> 13:38.609
It's getting bigger!
越来越大了！

13:40.069 --> 13:41.403
Nothing a little pimple
cream can't cure.
没什么小痘痘
霜不能治愈。

13:42.988 --> 13:45.658
Ah, that's more like it.
啊，这更像是这样。

13:45.741 --> 13:46.825
All better.
一切都好起来了。

13:46.909 --> 13:48.827
See Patrick?
看到帕特里克吗？

13:48.911 --> 13:50.287
Sure do.
当然可以。

13:50.371 --> 13:52.373
Well, I'm gonna
go sit in my hole.
嗯，我要
去我的洞里坐吧。

13:52.456 --> 13:53.499
Catch you later, pal.
稍后见，朋友。

13:53.582 --> 13:55.334
Bye, Patrick.
再见，帕特里克。

13:55.417 --> 13:56.293
La, la, la...
啦啦啦……

14:04.593 --> 14:08.681
Ah, this feels better.
啊，这样感觉好多了。

14:08.764 --> 14:10.349
Let's see...
让我们来看看...

14:10.432 --> 14:12.560
a four letter word.
一个四个字母的单词。

14:12.643 --> 14:14.937
Meaning an uncomfortable
sensation on the dermis, hmm...
表示不舒服的意思
真皮层的感觉，嗯……

14:20.859 --> 14:22.861
Ooh...
哦...

14:22.945 --> 14:24.780
Itch!
痒！

14:30.828 --> 14:36.917
Don't worry, SpongeBob,
everyone gets itchy, swollen
skin rash now and then.
别担心，海绵宝宝，
每个人都会发痒、肿胀
时不时出现皮疹。

14:37.001 --> 14:40.462
Just don't scratch it,
and it'll go away...
只要别刮伤就好
然后它就会消失...

14:40.546 --> 14:44.550
Eventually.
最终。

14:51.140 --> 14:53.976
There, out of sight,
out of mind.
在那里，看不见的地方，
失去理智。

15:07.740 --> 15:11.285
I won't let this minor setback
hinder my fry cooking.
我不会让这个小挫折
妨碍我炒菜。

15:12.995 --> 15:17.583
now nothing can distract me
from fryin' up those patties.
现在没有什么可以分散我的注意力
从煎那些肉饼开始。

15:17.666 --> 15:22.713
Except maybe this
unbearable itchiness.
也许除了这个
难以忍受的瘙痒。

15:22.796 --> 15:25.674
Must... Stop... Scratching!
必须...停止...抓挠！

15:25.758 --> 15:27.384
SpongeBob, ah...!
海绵宝宝，啊……！

15:30.846 --> 15:31.847
SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝。

15:31.930 --> 15:33.432
Huh?
啊？

15:33.515 --> 15:34.850
Oh, hi Squidward.
哦，嗨章鱼哥。

15:34.933 --> 15:36.935
SpongeBob, why are
you all puffy?
海绵宝宝，为什么
你们都浮肿吗？

15:37.019 --> 15:38.646
All whaty?
都什么？

15:38.729 --> 15:40.981
Your skin, SpongeBob, what's
wrong with your skin?
你的皮肤，海绵宝宝，是什么
你的皮肤有问题吗？

15:41.065 --> 15:45.986
Oh that, it's nothing really
Squidward, just a little
blemish, that's all.
哦那个，其实没什么
章鱼哥，一点点
瑕疵，仅此而已。

15:46.070 --> 15:47.780
Aah...!
啊啊……！

15:50.324 --> 15:51.617
That's no blemish...
这不算什么瑕疵吧...

15:51.700 --> 15:53.160
Help me!
帮我！

15:53.243 --> 15:56.372
Oh, I'll help you alright.
哦，我会帮你的。

15:57.706 --> 15:58.791
SWAT team.
特警队。

16:00.000 --> 16:01.126
We'll be right over.
我们马上就过去。

16:04.713 --> 16:06.340
Hold it right there!
就稳住那儿吧！

16:07.716 --> 16:09.551
Dear Neptune's trident.
亲爱的海王星的三叉戟。

16:09.635 --> 16:11.762
This is the most
severe case of ick yet.
这是最
病情严重的还没有。

16:11.845 --> 16:12.846
Stop!
停止！

16:12.930 --> 16:13.972
You fool!
你这个傻瓜！

16:14.056 --> 16:15.516
Do you wanna get infected?
你想被感染吗？

16:15.599 --> 16:17.810
This is a job for
the hazmat division.
这是一份工作
危险品部门。

16:17.893 --> 16:18.894
Get back!
回来吧！

16:18.977 --> 16:19.978
I said get back!
我说回来吧！

16:20.062 --> 16:22.189
Back I say!
我说回来！

16:25.192 --> 16:26.860
What's going on, Squidward?
发生什么事了，章鱼哥？

16:26.944 --> 16:28.529
Ah...!
啊...！

16:31.740 --> 16:34.368
Here's your change, sir.
这是您找的零钱，先生。

16:34.451 --> 16:37.204
Oh why, thank you very much,
young man.
噢，为什么，非常感谢，
年轻人。

16:39.915 --> 16:41.458
What was that?
那是什么？

16:41.542 --> 16:47.381
No, no Mr. Squidward,
that can't be the ick.
不，不，章鱼哥先生，
那不可能是病。

16:47.464 --> 16:51.677
Ooh, where am I?
哦，我在哪儿？

16:51.760 --> 16:52.928
Whoa...!
哇...！

16:53.011 --> 16:56.724
Mmm, hmm, yes...
嗯嗯，是啊……

16:56.807 --> 16:59.143
Who are you people?
你们是谁？

16:59.226 --> 17:01.186
I wanna go home.
我想回家。

17:01.270 --> 17:02.896
You are home, SpongeBob.
你到家了，海绵宝宝。

17:02.980 --> 17:05.941
You just need to stay in this
bubble until the ick clears up.
你只需要留在这个
冒泡直至症状消失。

17:06.024 --> 17:08.068
Where's my snail, Gary?
我的蜗牛在哪里，加里？

17:08.152 --> 17:09.903
We've taken care of your pet.
我们已经照顾好你的宠物了。

17:09.987 --> 17:11.447
Meow.
喵。

17:11.530 --> 17:12.656
Gary?
加里？

17:12.740 --> 17:13.741
Whoa!
哇！

17:13.824 --> 17:16.160
He appears stable, sir.
他看起来很稳定，先生。

17:16.243 --> 17:18.037
All right boys,
let's pack it up.
好吧，孩子们，
我们把它打包吧。

17:31.925 --> 17:34.178
Wow...
哇...

17:37.514 --> 17:38.557
Huh?
啊？

17:38.640 --> 17:39.725
What is this?
这是什么？

17:39.808 --> 17:41.727
Patrick, stop, stop!
帕特里克，停下来，停下来！

17:41.810 --> 17:43.437
You're gonna pop it!
你会弹出它！

17:43.520 --> 17:44.980
Really?
真的吗？

17:45.063 --> 17:46.148
How 'bout if I
squeeze it like this?
如果我怎么样
像这样挤？

17:47.524 --> 17:48.484
Or this?
还是这个？

17:48.567 --> 17:49.485
No!
不！

17:49.568 --> 17:50.569
Or this?
还是这个？

17:50.652 --> 17:52.070
Ah, Patrick!
啊，帕特里克！

17:52.154 --> 17:53.489
How many times
do I have to tell you?
多少次
我必须告诉你吗？

17:53.572 --> 17:54.698
Be careful!
当心！

17:54.782 --> 17:56.283
Sorry.
对不起。

17:56.366 --> 17:58.285
Hey, wanna play a game
of pirate wrestling?
嘿嘿想玩游戏
海盗摔跤？

17:58.368 --> 18:00.329
Sure, let's begin.
当然，让我们开始吧。

18:01.288 --> 18:05.000
Um... Patrick?
嗯...帕特里克？

18:05.083 --> 18:07.461
I win, I win, I win!
我赢了，我赢了，我赢了！

18:07.544 --> 18:08.670
Patrick?
帕特里克？

18:08.754 --> 18:11.006
Go Patrick, go Patrick,
go Patrick.
帕特里克加油，帕特里克加油，
帕特里克去吧。

18:11.089 --> 18:12.216
Patrick!
帕特里克！

18:12.299 --> 18:14.009
What am I gonna do?
我要做什么？

18:14.092 --> 18:15.260
My bubble is destroyed.
我的泡沫被摧毁了。

18:15.344 --> 18:16.970
I've got an idea.
我有一个主意。

18:17.054 --> 18:19.264
There's no time for games, Pat.
没有时间玩游戏了，帕特。

18:19.348 --> 18:21.099
Now think, SpongeBob.
现在想想，海绵宝宝。

18:21.183 --> 18:24.353
The fate of Bikini
Bottom rests in your hands.
比基尼的命运
底部就在你的手中。

18:24.436 --> 18:26.355
Huh?
啊？

18:26.438 --> 18:28.273
Patrick, you're a genius.
帕特里克，你是个天才。

18:28.357 --> 18:30.150
And this one's mobile.
而且这个是手机的。

18:30.234 --> 18:31.568
Now I can go back to work.
现在我可以回去工作了。

18:35.197 --> 18:37.908
Squidward, help!
章鱼哥，救命啊！

18:37.991 --> 18:39.618
Help me flip these patties.
帮我翻转这些馅饼。

18:39.701 --> 18:41.787
We've got growling
stomachs out there.
我们有咆哮
肚子在那里。

18:41.870 --> 18:43.956
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.
不，不，不，不，不，不，不。

18:44.039 --> 18:46.834
Then would it be too much
trouble to ask his
high and mightiness
那么会不会太过分了
麻烦问一下他的
威风凛凛

18:46.917 --> 18:51.088
to take these patties
out to the customers?
拿这些肉饼
出给客户？

18:51.171 --> 18:53.841
: If only
SpongeBob were here.
: 如果只是
海绵宝宝来了。

18:53.924 --> 18:57.052
If SpongeBob were here,
we'd be covered in ick.
如果海绵宝宝在这里的话
我们会浑身恶心。

18:59.555 --> 19:02.182
Lunch is served.
供应午餐。

19:02.266 --> 19:05.644
Eat up kids.
吃饱孩子们。

19:10.732 --> 19:11.942
Ah...
啊...

19:13.443 --> 19:16.655
Why am I so itchy?
为什么我这么痒？

19:16.738 --> 19:17.781
No...
不...

19:17.865 --> 19:19.283
Ahh...!
啊……！

19:19.366 --> 19:21.326
Squidward: SpongeBob
gave me the ick!
章鱼哥：海绵宝宝
让我恶心了！

19:21.410 --> 19:24.037
And I gave it to all you people!
我把它给了你们所有人！

19:27.332 --> 19:30.919
Stay back, you diseased freaks!
退后一步，你们这些病态的怪物！

19:31.003 --> 19:33.338
What's all the commotion about?
到底是为了什么？

19:33.422 --> 19:37.885
The commotion, my dear Krabs, is
regarding the hygiene standards
of your eating establishment,
亲爱的蟹老板，这场骚动是
关于卫生标准
您的餐饮场所，

19:37.968 --> 19:40.095
which appear to be inadequate.
这似乎是不够的。

19:40.178 --> 19:42.139
Inadequate?
不足？

19:42.222 --> 19:46.268
I'll have you know, the staff at
the Krusty Krab take a solemn
pledge to show up
我会让你知道的，工作人员
蟹堡王庄严地举行
承诺出现

19:46.351 --> 19:49.688
everyday of the week clean
and disease free.
一周中的每一天都是干净的
并且无疾病。

19:49.771 --> 19:51.231
SpongeBob: Sorry I'm late,
Mr. Krabs.
海绵宝宝：抱歉我来晚了
蟹老板。

19:51.315 --> 19:53.317
SpongeBob SquarePants...
海绵宝宝方裤...

19:53.400 --> 20:00.532
Returning for duty, sir.
回来执勤了，先生。

20:02.117 --> 20:06.622
Is that what you consider clean
and disease free, Krabby?
这就是你认为的干净吗
没有疾病，克拉比？

20:06.705 --> 20:08.999
I say we ransack this
greasy disease shack.
我说我们搜查这个
油腻病棚。

20:09.082 --> 20:10.500
Who's with me?
谁和我在一起？

20:10.584 --> 20:12.628
I'm with you, you funny
talking fella, come on.
我和你在一起，你很有趣
会说话的家伙，来吧。

20:12.711 --> 20:15.505
It wasn't me, it was Squidward.
不是我，是章鱼哥。

20:15.589 --> 20:18.050
He gave you all the ick.
他给了你所有的恶心。

20:18.133 --> 20:19.718
No, no I didn't.
不，不，我没有。

20:19.801 --> 20:21.053
It was SpongeBob.
这是海绵宝宝。

20:21.136 --> 20:24.640
He's infected the
entire Krusty Krab.
他感染了
整个蟹堡王。

20:26.350 --> 20:29.895
Let us apprehend that
careless contaminator.
让我们明白这一点
粗心的污染者。

20:44.785 --> 20:45.702
meow.
喵。

20:52.125 --> 20:53.627
Stop!
停止！

20:53.710 --> 20:55.921
You're pushing
out more of the ick.
你在推
出了更多的病。

20:59.758 --> 21:01.718
No...!
不...！

21:14.815 --> 21:15.983
stop it!
停下来！

21:16.066 --> 21:17.526
You're ticklin' me, Squidward!
你在逗我呢，章鱼哥！

21:17.609 --> 21:20.070
It's not me, Mr. Krabs.
这不是我，蟹老板。

21:21.446 --> 21:23.365
Gary B. Snail.
加里·B·蜗牛.

21:23.448 --> 21:27.285
Don't you know it's impolite
to feed off of other people
without permission?
你不知道这样很不礼貌吗
以他人为食
未经许可？

21:27.369 --> 21:30.330
He's just doing
his job, SpongeBob.
他只是在做
他的工作，海绵宝宝。

21:30.414 --> 21:31.790
He's a bottom feeder, remember?
他是个底部喂食者，还记得吗？

21:31.873 --> 21:33.250
See?
看？

21:33.333 --> 21:35.043
The little fella
licked me clean.
小家伙
把我舔干净了。

21:35.127 --> 21:39.089
I'm cured, and he'll clean the
ick off any surface.
我痊愈了，他会清理
清除任何表面。

21:39.172 --> 21:40.215
Even squid.
甚至鱿鱼。

21:43.218 --> 21:44.553
Oh, oh, me next.
哦哦，下一个是我。

21:44.636 --> 21:45.971
Where are your manners?
你的礼貌在哪里？

21:46.054 --> 21:47.764
It's ladies first.
这是女士优先。

21:47.848 --> 21:50.934
I believe the expression is
"starfish first".
我相信这个表达是
“海星第一”。

21:51.018 --> 21:54.813
I supersede all of you,
for I have an exotic accent.
我取代了你们所有人
因为我有异国口音。

21:54.896 --> 21:57.482
Hey, hey, hey,
there's no need to fight.
嘿嘿嘿嘿
没有必要去战斗。

21:57.566 --> 22:00.652
'Cause I got a solution
I'll be happy with.
因为我找到了解决办法
我会很高兴的。

22:00.736 --> 22:03.905
Step up to be de-icked, only $5.
赶快去除臭，只需 5 美元。

22:08.577 --> 22:10.328
Now can I get ya a Krabby Patty?
现在我可以给你买一份蟹肉饼吗？

22:10.412 --> 22:15.417
In light of today's events, that
notion is crass and offensive.
鉴于今天发生的事件，
这种想法是粗鲁且令人反感的。

22:15.500 --> 22:17.252
I'll take two please.
请我拿两个。

22:17.336 --> 22:19.296
All right.
好的。

22:19.379 --> 22:21.256
Here ya go, Mr. Krabs.
给你，蟹老板。

22:21.339 --> 22:25.385
Another $5, for
another de-icking.
另外 5 美元，用于
另一个除臭。

22:29.431 --> 22:32.642
Look Gare, you made
me all sparkly.
瞧，Gare，你做到了
我都闪闪发光。

22:32.726 --> 22:36.396
You're the best bottom feeder a
sponge could ever have.
你是最好的底层喂食者
海绵可能曾经有过。

22:36.480 --> 22:39.357
Aye, and a great money
maker you are, too.
是啊，还有一大笔钱
你也是制造者。

22:39.441 --> 22:40.400
Now back to work.
现在回去工作了。

现在回去工作了。